WEBVTT

00:01:29.317 --> 00:01:31.928
as frivolous as bubble gum --

00:01:31.952 --> 00:01:33.287
"AfroBubbleGum."

00:01:34.421 --> 00:01:37.686
So I'm not saying that
agenda art isn't important;

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:39.985
I'm the chairperson of a charity

00:01:40.009 --> 00:01:46.966
that deals with films and theaters
that write about HIV and radicalization

00:01:46.990 --> 00:01:49.253
and female genital mutilation.

00:01:49.277 --> 00:01:51.558
It's vital and important art,

00:01:51.582 --> 00:01:55.134
but it cannot be the only art
that comes out of the continent.

00:01:56.372 --> 00:01:58.708
We have to tell more stories

00:01:58.732 --> 00:02:00.147
that are vibrant.